    "@value" : "Invocation of a function in a pipeline. Can reference a defined Function by name, OR inline a callable directly for external library functions, OR inline an equation, OR use class_call for class instantiation. Mirrors Function attributes so pipeline steps can be self-contained. The `name` is an optional step label (used in pipelines for keyed access to step outputs); it is NOT a global identifier (singleton uses like `loss`, `observable` may omit it)."
  } ],
