    "@value" : "External ontology IRIs (typically GO, ChEBI, UBERON, CL, MeSH) that this entity is a surrogate / abstraction / model of. Replaces the legacy OWL pattern `tvbo:surrogate_of` by carrying the link inline with the YAML data instance. Multiple IRIs allowed: a single parameter may abstract several biological processes (e.g. a synaptic conductance grounding both GO:0060079 (excitatory PSP) and GO:0007268 (chemical synaptic transmission))."
  } ],
